    "item_id": "testament_of_the_king",
    "display_name": "Testament of the Dead King",
    "prompt": "Pick up   [E]",
    "interact_distance": 1.8,
    "read_text": "If you read this, my liege, you have risen. A hundred years ago the gods came down with their church and named you a tyrant. They bound the world in chains and hanged you before your own people. We, your court, kept your body and your crown. Rest by the fire, take up your blade, and go. The gods sleep on the backs of their titans now. Wake them.",
